OL,3,AMan admits killing schoolboy in
OL,4,Ahit-and-run crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has admitted causing death by
OL,7,Fdangerous driving after killing
OL,8,F12-year-old Keaton Slater in a
OL,9,Fhit-and-run crash.
OL,11,FLatvian national Dolars Aleksanders was
OL,12,Fextradited to the UK last month,
OL,13,Ffollowing the death of Keaton, who was
OL,14,Ffatally injured on his way home from
OL,15,Fschool in Coventry, in 2024.
OL,17,FAleksanders, 23, appeared at Warwick
OL,18,FCrown Court via a virtual link from HMP
OL,19,FDovegate and spoke only to enter his
OL,20,Fguilty plea.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
